# build-ws-frame returns a dict with keys: header, payload, frame.
# Mask-key constructed with chr() since LLT only supports \n \t \r escapes.

[include %libdir "protocols/websocket.llt"]
---
[keys [call %.build-ws-frame 1 "Hi" [str [chr 1] [chr 2] [chr 3] [chr 4]]]]
=== error
[E022] unexpected named argument: header (valid parameter names: xs) (defined at 175:5-178:39)
  in [set ...] at 175:5-178:39
  in [set ...] at 175:5-178:39
  in materialized at 146:5-150:66
  in [if ...] at 146:5-150:66
  in [if ...] at 273:9-275:72
  in [<dot-access> ...] at 5:7-5:75
  in type guard at 5:7-5:75
  in [keys ...] at 5:1-5:76
